                              "type": "html",
                              "html": "<p>PhD. in Computer Science (AI Hybrid Neuro-Symbolic Systems) from Institut National Polytechique de Grenoble – INPG/IMAG, France (1998). Professor and Researcher of the ICMC Institute (Computing Dept.) at USP – University of São Paulo / Campus São Carlos.</p>"
